ced corrosion resistance, especially on stub shafts. These components are produced through high-quality casting and forging processes, with major customers across the USA.<\/p><p>In addition to end and pinion yokes, EAL offers premium Slip Yoke and Flange Yoke solutions for a wide range of automotive and industrial applications. Our Slip Yokes deliver precision fitment and long service life, while our Flange Yokes ensure robust, secure connections within driveshaft assemblies\u2014guaranteeing smooth and efficient torque transfer.<\/p><p>\u00a0<\/p>\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t<div class=\"elementor-element elementor-element-a729b83 e-con-full e-flex e-con e-child\" data-id=\"a729b83\" data-element_type=\"container\" data-e-type=\"container\">\n\t\t<div class=\"elementor-element elementor-element-588c58c e-con-full e-flex e-con e-child\" data-id=\"588c58c\" data-element_type=\"container\" data-e-type=\"container\">\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-element elementor-element-dc6ad9d elementor-widget elementor-widget-text-editor\" data-id=\"dc6ad9d\" data-element_type=\"widget\" data-e-type=\"widget\" data-widget_type=\"text-editor.default\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<p>Whether you need standard or custom-engineered yokes, EAL provides exceptional durability, superior quality, and reliable performance. With a strong focus on customer satisfaction, we are your trusted partner for Slip Yokes, Flange Yokes, and all driveline components.<\/p><p>We currently operate with an installed manufacturing capacity of approximately 120,000 yokes per annum.<\/p>\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t<div class=\"elementor-element elementor-element-784f8d9 e-flex e-con-boxed e-con e-parent\" data-id=\"784f8d9\" data-element_type=\"container\" data-e-type=\"container\" data-settings=\"{&quot;background_background&quot;:&quot;classic&quot;}\">\n\t\t\t\t\t<div class=\"e-con-inner\">\n\t\t<div class=\"e